<div class="page-title">🛡️ <span class="page-title-text">Admin</span></div>
<p class="page-subtitle">Manage SME owner accounts and datasets, and browse the TAM end-user evaluation data they log at <code>/evaluation</code>.</p>

<div class="kpi-row">
  <div class="stat-tile">
    <div class="stat-label">SME owner accounts</div>
    <div class="stat-value"><%= smeCount %></div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-tile">
    <div class="stat-label">Admin accounts</div>
    <div class="stat-value"><%= adminCount %></div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-tile">
    <div class="stat-label">Datasets uploaded</div>
    <div class="stat-value"><%= datasetCount %></div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-tile">
    <div class="stat-label">Evaluations completed</div>
    <div class="stat-value"><%= completed %></div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-tile">
    <div class="stat-label">Evaluations in progress</div>
    <div class="stat-value"><%= inProgress %></div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-tile">
    <div class="stat-label">Not started yet</div>
    <div class="stat-value"><%= notStarted %></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="form-card wide">
  <div class="form-title" style="font-size: 18px;">Quick links</div>
  <table class="table-simple">
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Manage SME Accounts</strong><br /><span style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px;">Look up an SME owner account, change its password, or add/remove an admin.</span></td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/admin/accounts">Open</a></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Manage Datasets</strong><br /><span style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px;">Every dataset any SME owner has uploaded — view its analytics read-only, or delete it.</span></td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/admin/datasets">Open</a></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>View Evaluation Report</strong><br /><span style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px;">Browse each account's task-walkthrough log and 17-item questionnaire, plus the cross-respondent summary.</span></td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/admin/evaluations">Open</a></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
